Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:49.04,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&HAE85E8&}いつも笑顔で立ち上がれるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.24,0:15:54.53,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&H44FFF6&}悲しみから教わった温かさが
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:59.90,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&HC6EA2A&}胸に {\c&HAE85E8&}灯る {\c&H44FFF6&}それは 愛しく{\clip(0,0,1920,97)}
