Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.25,0:17:57.20,Default2,,0,0,0,,噢... 噢噢!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:18:03.15,Default2,,0,0,0,,没错 只有这力量 才能终结卡罗尔!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:35.21,Ripple,,0,0,0,,赤红女王的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:38.10,Zeal,,0,0,0,,结束了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.25,0:18:38.92,Meteor,,0,0,0,,呼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:40.31,Ripple,,0,0,0,,哈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.67,0:18:44.73,Meteor,,0,0,0,,没了吧！饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.91,0:18:47.23,Ripple,,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:49.67,Zeal,,0,0,0,,嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.95,0:18:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.90,0:19:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.88,0:19:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？没受伤吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,流星！流~星！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:11.74,Meteor,,0,0,0,,别... 别冲着耳朵喊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.91,0:19:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,篝呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.86,0:19:14.12,Zeal,,0,0,0,,还行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,水萌...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.06,0:19:17.19,Ripple,,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:19.39,Ripple,,0,0,0,,没问题的问题哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了... 太好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:39.56,Ripple,,0,0,0,,这次保护好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.77,0:19:43.77,Ripple,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝比亚和大家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:20:00.35,Ripple,,0,0,0,,纳比尤！流星！小篝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:02.70,Ripple,,0,0,0,,回大家那里去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:04.70,Ripple,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.71,0:21:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,水萌... 大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.18,0:21:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:26.01,Ripple,,0,0,0,,-我们回来了!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.01,0:21:28.01,Ripple,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.27,0:23:04.10,Default2,,0,0,0,,赤红女王似乎输了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.19,0:23:08.16,Default2,,0,0,0,,她的手段就是过于激进
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.16,0:23:13.07,Default2,,0,0,0,,这个世界 应该再安稳一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.04,0:23:20.77,Default2,,0,0,0,,不然的话 就由我们来维持爱丽丝比亚静寂的平稳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.77,0:23:22.77,Default2,,0,0,0,,
